'' A module's '*_test.tiko' is no part of it in a normal build: m_test.tiko does not even compile,
'' and 'tiko build' of the app that imports m succeeds (driver/modresolve.tiko ModuleFiles).
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.tfx/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.tfx
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/test-excl => build/.tfx/pkg
'' ARGS: build -target windows-x86_64 --manifest build/.tfx/pkg
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: build/.tfx/pkg/out/debug/app.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1
